-
-<p>Here the &lt;img width=400&gt; (error is almost zero).</p>
-
-<TABLE BORDER WIDTH="620" bgcolor="#dddddd">
-<TR>
- <TD WIDTH=420>
-  foo (single row table)
- </td>
- <td WIDTH=200>
-  bar (single row table)
- </td>
-</tr>
-</table>
-<TABLE BORDER WIDTH="620">
-<TR>
- <TD WIDTH=420>
-  foo
- </td>
- <td WIDTH=200>
-  bar
- </td>
-</tr>
-<TR>
